	(text "Diodes are TPESD0402G05V and TPESD0402G15V bidirectional ultra-low capacitance (0.05 pF) \nESD protection diode. No polarity - either pin may be tied to GND.\nProtects logic from ESD & cable transients.\nEncoder is the E6B2-CWZ6C NPN Open-collector Output Model."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.942 98.044 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
